      </td></tr></table><table><col class="asyn-l"></col><col class="asyn-r"></col><tr><td>&lt;X(s+1)&gt;</td><td><a id="XsPlus1"></a>
        
          <p class="aml" data-pagefind-body="1">Is the 64-bit name of the second general-purpose register to be compared and loaded.</p>
        
